  su name bridge request source stage ob name text hymn source brief to name bridge request be plus do
  su name bridge stage from text of ob of bridge request for name hymn bridge mind accordingto name hymn bridge checks to name text bridge out be hymn section verify do

  su name final chorus request begin stage ob text "TARGET_WORDS: 10-14\nSECTION_ROLE: MEMORY_ANCHOR_ESCALATION\nFORMAT: SINGLE_LINE\nTHE CHORUS:\n" to name text final chorus request be text do
  su name final chorus request chorus stage ob name text chorus out to name final chorus request be plus do
  su name final chorus request bridge header stage ob text "\n\nBRIDGE:\n" to name final chorus request be plus do
  su name final chorus request bridge stage ob name text bridge out to name final chorus request be plus do
  su name final chorus stage from text of ob of chorus out with text of ob of final chorus request to name text final chorus out be hymn final chorus build do
  su name hymn final chorus hook verify stage be verify as wo phrase count atleast num 1 atmost num 2 from name text final chorus out with name text hook out to name map hymn final chorus hook verify do
  ob text of pass of hymn final chorus hook verify to name text hymn final chorus hook pass be text do
  ob name text hymn final chorus hook pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "hymn final chorus hook defective" to name text hymn final chorus hook note be text do

  su name outro request begin stage ob text "TARGET_WORDS: 8-20\nSECTION_ROLE: OUTRO_CLOSURE\nFORMAT: CRUX_LINES\n" to name text outro request be text do
  su name outro request core lesson header stage ob text "\n\nCORE LESSON:\n" to name outro request be plus do
  su name outro request chorus stage ob name text final chorus out to name outro request be plus do
  su name outro request bridge header stage ob text "\n\nBRIDGE:\n" to name outro request be plus do
  su name outro request bridge stage ob name text bridge out to name outro request be plus do
  su name outro request source header stage ob text "\n\nSOURCE BRIEF:\n" to name outro request be plus do
  su name outro request source stage ob name text hymn source brief to name outro request be plus do
  su name outro stage from text of ob of outro request for name hymn outro mind accordingto name hymn outro checks to name text outro out be hymn section verify do

  su name hymn sheet stage to name text hymn out be hymn sheet assemble do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name hymn out to name text hymn out be command do
  su name hymn total hook verify stage be verify as wo phrase count atleast num 3 atmost num 6 from name text hymn out with name text hook out to name map hymn total hook verify do
  ob text of pass of hymn total hook verify to name text hymn total hook pass be text do
  ob name text hymn total hook pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "hymn hook repetition defective" to name text hymn total hook note be text do

  su name hymn out ret
prah

su name hymn source thrust from text transcript with text lyric to name text pass be ceremony def
  su name hymn source thrust request begin stage ob text "TRANSCRIPT:\n" to name text hymn source thrust request be text do
  su name hymn source thrust request source stage ob text of from of this to name text hymn source thrust request be plus do
  su name hymn source thrust request intent header stage ob text "\n\nGENERATOR_INTENT:\n" to name text hymn source thrust request be plus do
  su name hymn source thrust request intent stage ob text of ob of hymn source thrust intent to name text hymn source thrust request be plus do
  su name hymn source thrust request lyric header stage ob text "\n\nLYRIC:\n" to name text hymn source thrust request be plus do
  su name hymn source thrust request lyric stage ob text of with of this to name text hymn source thrust request be plus do
  su name pass stage to name text pass be hymn source thrust checked do
  su name pass ret
prah

su name hymn source thrust retry fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
  ob name text hymn source thrust pass be equally from text true then
  ob name text hymn goal state pass be equally from text true then be depart do
  su name hymn draft retry stage from text of ob of hymn script source with text of ob of hymn script hook hint to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript draft checked do
  su name hymn goal state retry stage from text of ob of manuscript out to name text hymn goal state pass be hymn positive language do
  su name hymn source thrust verify retry stage from text of ob of hymn script source with text of ob of manuscript out to name text hymn source thrust pass be hymn source thrust do
prah

su name hymn manuscript from text source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name script source stage ob text of from of this to name text hymn script source be text do
  ob text "" to name text hymn script hook hint be text do
  su name hymn draft stage from text of ob of hymn script source with text of ob of hymn script hook hint to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript draft checked do
  su name hymn goal state verify stage from text of ob of manuscript out to name text hymn goal state pass be hymn positive language do
  su name hymn source thrust verify stage from text of ob of hymn script source with text of ob of manuscript out to name text hymn source thrust pass be hymn source thrust do
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be hymn source thrust retry do
  ob name text hymn goal state pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "hymn goal state defective" to name text hymn goal state note be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "hymn source thrust defective" to name text hymn source thrust note be text do

  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name hymn manuscript from text source with text hook hint to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name script source stage ob text of from of this to name text hymn script source be text do
  su name script hook hint stage ob text of with of this to name text hymn script hook hint be text do

  su name hymn draft stage from text of ob of hymn script source with text of ob of hymn script hook hint to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript draft checked do
  su name hymn goal state verify stage from text of ob of manuscript out to name text hymn goal state pass be hymn positive language do
  su name hymn source thrust verify stage from text of ob of hymn script source with text of ob of manuscript out to name text hymn source thrust pass be hymn source thrust do
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be hymn source thrust retry do
  ob name text hymn goal state pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "hymn goal state defective" to name text hymn goal state note be text do
  ob name text hymn source thrust pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "hymn source thrust defective" to name text hymn source thrust note be text do

  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name hymn manuscript from filename source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name source stage from filename of from of this become wo text to name text hymn source be read do
  su name manuscript stage from text of ob of hymn source to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name hymn manuscript from filename source with text hook hint to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name source stage from filename of from of this become wo text to name text hymn source be read do
  su name manuscript stage from text of ob of hymn source with text of with of this to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name manuscript as wo hymn from text source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name draft stage from text of from of this to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name manuscript as wo hymn from filename source to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name draft stage from filename of from of this to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name manuscript as wo hymn from text source with text hook hint to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name draft stage from text of from of this with text of with of this to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

su name manuscript as wo hymn from filename source with text hook hint to name text manuscript out be ceremony def
  su name draft stage from filename of from of this with text of with of this to name text manuscript out be hymn manuscript do
  su name manuscript out ret
prah

exists su name hymn manuscript be export ya
exists su name hymn sheet assemble be export ya
exists su name manuscript as wo hymn be export ya
